.TH MYSTRCPY 3 "2024" "libmyutils" "User Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrcpy \- copy a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.B int mystrcpy(char *dest, const char *src);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrcpy()
function copies the string pointed to by
.IR src ,
including the null terminator, into the buffer pointed to by
.IR dest .
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters copied.
